  "content": "<p>模組由 Aes Efficio 製作</p>\n<h3>Dynamic Village 為 Create 模組增添了大量的村莊職業與建築。<a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/x2n2cv6/starongithub.png\" alt=\"star\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/sudolev/DynamicVillageMod/assets/61996958/40b915c2-4707-4376-a1c0-5ec6a5a55bcc\" alt=\"banner\"></p>\n<h1>功能列表</h1>\n<p><strong>機械工程師</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>買賣 Create 模組的載具零件</li>\n<li>關鍵方塊：藍圖桌</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>液壓工程師</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>買賣 Create 模組的流體管理零件，包含管道、泵浦、潛水裝備等</li>\n<li>關鍵方塊：物品排水槽</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>火車技師</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>買賣 Create 模組的火車系統零件</li>\n<li>關鍵方塊：火車站</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>礦工</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>買賣 Create 模組的採礦設備以及礦物/金屬</li>\n<li>關鍵方塊：機械鑽頭</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>共計 20 種平原、草原、沙漠、針葉林及雪地村莊建築</h3>\n<h1>貢獻指南</h1>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ben001109/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Ben001109</a> 將 Dynamic Village 移植至 1.20.1！</strong> 🎉</p>\n<h3>錯誤回報、建議與想法</h3>\n<p>錯誤回報、建議與想法極具價值，我們非常感激。您可以透過 GitHub Issue 進行聯繫。</p>\n<h3>翻譯</h3>\n<p>我們非常需要翻譯協助。最佳方式是提交 GitHub Issue 或 Pull Request。</p>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/EDGW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@EDGW</a> 將 Dynamic Village 翻譯為簡體中文。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/Khaogamermain01\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Khao</a> 將 Dynamic Village 翻譯為泰語。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/RemVan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@RemVan</a> 將 Dynamic Village 翻譯為俄語。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<h3>在 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdynamic-village%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上尋找 Dynamic Village</h3>\n<h4>在此處回報問題 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/5srLQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4tvGCgv/dynamicvillage.png\" alt=\"Dynamic Village Banner\"></a></p>\n<p>模組由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fowasp.umn.edu%252falexander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alexander Weimer</a> 製作 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fa0.ax%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">網站</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/a0ax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> · <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.linkedin.com%252fin%252falexander-weimer%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LinkedIn</a> · <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9cVn1s0AAAAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Google Scholar</a> · <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.researchgate.net%252fprofile%252fAlexander-Weimer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ResearchGate</a> · <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252forcid.org%252f0009-0009-7313-138X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ORCiD</a> · <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjyse.org%252farticles%252ferror-corrected-deep-learning-gregg-shorthand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文章</a></p>",
